  "description": "NHSOneLondon.AuditAndMetrics.Clients provides a Standard compliant client for recording\n\t\t\taudits, metrics and security audits. Writes are validated and stamped on the caller's\n\t\t\tthread and dispatched in the background, audits are also written to the host's ILogger,\n\t\t\tand completed metric spans are replayed to an ActivitySource for telemetry. Storage,\n\t\t\tidentity and request tracing are supplied by the host through the\n\t\t\tNHSOneLondon.AuditAndMetrics.Abstractions ports.",
